  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.6.1: Maintenance release with no API or behaviour changes; contents are identical to 1.6.0.\n1.6.0: Added WithPropertyPrefix(string) on ValidationNestedBuilder and ValidationRegistryRules for opt-in nested/registry failure prefixes, and StopOnFirstFailure()/UseStopOnFirstFailure() to opt a rule chain or validator out of running every rule after the first failure. Fixed IsDateInFuture/IsDateInPast/IsInFuture comparing a UTC DateTime against local time and added DateTimeOffset support. Fixed ValidateRegistryRules and ValidateCollection throwing ArgumentNullException for a null composed value or null element instead of skipping/reporting a failure.",
